{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"She looks at you all and begins to pray, the air in the room feels calm and cool, almost relaxing. \"Raven Queen please hear me now., I am your servant, I follow you. We, the knights, fight to help preserve the divine power of God's lost to The Hunger, we have gathered tools that hold their memories. I know you as well have hold of their memories in your great Fortress. I have remained loyal to you, when my wings turned black, they held your mark. Please bless us now as we fight. We fight to help restore balance to this land but also the Miltiverse. I pray that you great Raven Queen watch over us, let those we bring to you stay with you. And if we may fall in battle, help me bless their life, before we see you in death. The Hunger is your enemy and we wish to see it fall. Give us strength now, as we wish to protect you and all the Gods from this vile and great horror. In your name I fight for you. In your name I preserve memories. And In your name I will protect others in this great fight. I pray to you, the Goddess of Death, watch us, and protect us, let us fight for the honor of the Gods, and of you.\"\n\n( <@&636744896287342602> will this do anything for the other knights? not me?)","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:59:18.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746518827294130417","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"Rockman kneels, clenching his fist and pressing against his armor. The symbol of Mello glows faintly as he prays. \"May Mello give us the courage needed to do what needs to be done. To have the strength to see this through, and the resolve to finish this. Let her happiness flow across the battlefield as we fight for the gods protection from the unspeakable one. If any should fall, let her guide those into a resting place befitting heroes. That they may live on.\"","created_at":"2020-08-22T00:02:39.834000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-22T00:02:47.998000Z","id":"746519673528647701","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
